OL,3,GNEWSACrash leaves motorway shut in both
OL,4,Adirections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M4 in Berkshire has
OL,7,Fbeen closed both ways after a crash.
OL,9,FThe motorway is shut between junction
OL,10,F8/9 for Maidenhead and junction 10 for
OL,11,FReading. National Highways said the
OL,12,Fcrash happened on Wednesday shortly
OL,13,Fafter 21:00 BST and it believed three
OL,14,Fvehicles were involved.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police said the westbound
OL,17,Fside of the motorway, heading from
OL,18,FLondon towards Reading, was likely to
OL,19,Fstay closed for "a number of hours"
OL,20,Fwith the eastbound side likely to
OL,21,Freopen at some time on Thursday
OL,22,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
