OL,3,GNEWSACrash leaves motorway shut in both
OL,4,Adirections
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic heading west is being diverted
OL,7,Foff the motorway at junction 8/9 and
OL,8,Fonto the A404M and east off at junction
OL,9,F10 to the A329M northbound. Drivers are
OL,10,Fbeing warned to allow extra time.
